.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-accept 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-accept \- Settle a ref conflict here by taking one signer\*(Aqs value
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm accept\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPO\fR> <\fIREFNAME\fR> <\fISIGNER\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Settle a ref conflict here by taking one signer\*(Aqs value
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
A repo ID or link
.TP
<\fIREFNAME\fR>
The ref in conflict, for example refs/heads/main
.TP
<\fISIGNER\fR>
The signer (key ID, hex or base32) whose value to take
